# run3-r4-cards-v2-slim-tracks: Single-track-corrected EEC and cone components; residual pair correction OFF.
# Preparation, not a production submission or a physics validation.
# Run from repository root; all payload paths are repository-relative.
# Report 40-80,80-120,120-160 GeV; both n=1,2; strict pair pT>2.
# Stored activity is not an event cut or percentile certification.
# No subtraction happens in the analyzer. pp nominal no-subtraction remains a downstream choice.
# Ordinary matcher is the retained legacy path, not the strict OO NH pilot.
# Data trigger is inherited from its current R4 base; check actual sample/trigger acceptance.
# TEMPLATE ONLY: resolve MIXING_LIST before use.
DataType 11
McCorrelationType 0
MatchJets 0
TriggerSelection 8
FilledHistograms 31
JetType 1
JetAxis 1
JetEtaCut 1.6
MinJetPtCut 40
MaxJetPtCut 5020
CutBadPhi 0
CutWithEtaCM 0
MinMaxTrackPtFraction 0.01
MaxMaxTrackPtFraction 0.98
JetUncertainty 0
Run3JetID 1
Run3JetIDTable MiniPOG20261108
Run3JetQA 1
Run3JEC 1
Run3UsePpL1FastJet 0
ApplyJetVeto 1
JetVetoMapFile jetVetoMaps/pp2024/Summer24Prompt24_RunBCDEFGHI.root
JetVetoMapHistogram jetvetomap_all
JetVetoPtConvention stored
JetVetoInputMinPt 15
Run3TrackSelection Nominal
TrackEtaCut 2.4
MinTrackPtCut 0.5
MaxTrackPtCut 500
MaxTrackPtRelativeError 0.1
VertexMaxDistance 3
SubeventCut 2
TrackEfficiencyVariation 0
JetPtWeight 0
DisableTrackPairEfficiencyCorrection 1
ZVertexCut 15
LowPtHatCut -1
HighPtHatCut 1
MultiplicityMode 0
JetRadius 0.4
WeightExponent 1 2
SmearDeltaR 0
SmearEnergyWeight 0
JetPtBinEdgesEEC 5 10 20 40 80 120 160 200 300 500 5020
TrackPtBinEdgesEEC 0.5 1 1.5 2 2.5 3 3.5 4 300
SkipCovarianceMatrix 0
MinJetPtUnfoldingReco 40
MinJetPtUnfoldingTruth 5
CentralityBinEdges -1 100
TrackPtBinEdges 0.7 1 2 3 4 8 12 300
PtHatBinEdges 0 30 50 80 120 170 220 280 370 460
BackgroundMethods 7
MegaSkimMixing 0
EventMatchForMixing 0
BinnedMixing 0
VzMixingBins -0.5 1
HiBinMixingBins -0.5 1
HFEnergyMixingBins 0 1
MultiplicityMixingBins -0.5 1
HFEnergyShift 0
DebugLevel 0
MaxEventsPerFile 0
ChannelRadiusCode 4
MinPairTrackPt 2
FirstUnfoldedJetPtBin 3
LastUnfoldedJetPtBin 5
MixingFileList @MIXING_LIST@
